        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86319, Modern Podium Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Podium Cabinet Knob is available in 1-1/4 inch or 1-3/4 inch sizes. This modern square cabinet knob comes in your choice of contemporary finish colors. Emtek's Modern Podium Knob can be used on small doors and drawers anywhere in the house. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86319-specifications.gif?v=1774586591\" width=\"600\" height=\"157\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Podium Cabinet Knob Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Podium Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86319:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-1/4\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86320:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-3/4\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
